  "about": {
    "pullquote": "Phoenix heat, late nights, dark rooms.",
    "bio": [
      "That's where GRLSCRY comes from.",
      "DJ and producer building house that doesn't ask for permission—it just takes the room. Dark, high-energy, made for 3 a.m. when the filters are off and people actually move.",
      "No chasing trends, no forced hype. Just clean, heavy sound that hits your chest and stays there. Raw emotion wrapped in tight rhythm. Tracks that don't fade, sets that don't apologize, a brand that shows up the same way every time: intentional, untouchable, a little dangerous.",
      "Step in. Feel it. Get on the ride."
    ],
    "philosophy": "GRLSCRY: Dark House That Hits Different. High Energy, Late Nights, No Compromises. Ready to Feel the Pulse? Explore Releases, Gigs, and the Raw Behind the Beats.",
