    "inspiration": "GRLSCRY pulls from the real late-night underbelly: blacked-out warehouses, bass that hits your chest, feral crowds moving like tomorrow's cancelled. Sweat, smoke, glances that stick under dim strobes. Built by people who already own the room. Beats land with quiet empathy, natural charisma, subtle edge."
